      "text": "Heavy Rainfall Warning No. 5 #NCR_PRSD\nWeather System: Shear Line\nIssued at: 5:00 AM, 04 November 2025(Tuesday)\n\nYELLOW WARNING LEVEL: Quezon, Batangas and Laguna.\nASSOCIATED HAZARD: FLOODING in flood-prone areas.\nMeanwhile, expect light to moderate rains over Pampanga, Bataan, Zambales and Tarlac within the next 3 hours.\nLight to moderate with occasional heavy rains affecting Rizal, Metro Manila, Cavite, Bulacan(Dona Remedios Trinidad, Norzagaray, San Jose del Monte, Bulakan, Obando, Meycauayan, Marilao, Santa Maria, Bocaue, Angat) and Nueva Ecija(General Tinio, Gabaldon) which may persist within 3 hours and may affect nearby areas.\n\nThe public and the Disaster Risk Reduction and Management Offices concerned are advised to MONITOR the weather condition and watch for the next warning to be issued at 8:00 AM today.\nFor more information and queries, please call telephone numbers 8927-1335 and 8927-2877 or log on to https://t.co/59mTpZJq1n.",
